<title>USA: Hallwood Realty Q1 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Hallwood Realty Q1 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>					   1997			 1996</p>
<p>   Total revenues	    12,908,000		  12,432,000</p>
<p> Operating expenses	   9,855,000		  10,239,000</p>
<p> Non-cash depreciation</p>
<p>  &amp; amortization expense    2,985,000		   4,713,000</p>
<p>   Total expenses	    12,840,000		  14,952,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		 68,000		 (2,520,000)</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per unit	0.04			(1.43)</p>
<p>Average number of units</p>
<p>   outstanding		  1,673,000		   1,748,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Hallwood Realty Partners LP</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610)</p>
